reference-semantics/semantics/subscript.k:43:  // ==== Slice: obj[lo:hi:step] (list / str) — CPython slice.indices ==========
reference-semantics/semantics/subscript.k:54:  rule <k> Subscript(OBJ:Val, Slice(LO:Bound, HI:Bound, ST:Bound)) => #evalB(LO) ~> #slLo(OBJ, HI, ST) ... </k>
