reference-semantics/semantics/core.k:137:  // bindings; abstract claim values take the plain rule unchanged) — this
reference-semantics/semantics/core.k:156:  // the ONE predefined builtins scope (the -1 frame; claims write `-1 |-> builtinsScope`)
